      "cooked": "<p>I have built a full Hospitality module that integrates native Stock and Accounting. It handles Reservations, Night Audit, and Folio Management. I am maintaining it at <a href=\"https://github.com/Gifted87/erpnext_hospitality_core\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">[Link to my Github repo]</a>. Is there interest in adopting this into the official Frappe App ecosystem?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/b/eb5d506869ccf9e749d198a69684d784c5025bcc.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/eb5d506869ccf9e749d198a69684d784c5025bcc\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-12-20 043933\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/b/eb5d506869ccf9e749d198a69684d784c5025bcc_2_690x433.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-12-20 043933\" data-base62-sha1=\"xA8841hkMgijvYbhqWQp3sAVAcs\" width=\"690\" height=\"433\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/b/eb5d506869ccf9e749d198a69684d784c5025bcc_2_690x433.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/b/eb5d506869ccf9e749d198a69684d784c5025bcc_2_1035x649.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/b/eb5d506869ccf9e749d198a69684d784c5025bcc.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F8F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-12-20 043933</span><span class=\"informations\">1222×767 110 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/4/64b5eeaa8529b3fef4aa21e37981473839857bf4.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/64b5eeaa8529b3fef4aa21e37981473839857bf4\" title=\"